{"id":"05bdd43d-3041-42eb-a61b-29cc548c4be6","object":"chat.completion","created":1795243277,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"SELECT order_id, order_item_id, freight_value\nFROM order_items\nWHERE freight_value IS NOT NULL\nORDER BY freight_value DESC, order_id ASC, order_item_id ASC\nLIMIT 5;","reasoning_content":"我们需要回答用户问题，只输出SQL。需要理解schema给的表。用户问“运费最高的 5 条订单明细是哪几条？” 表 order_items 有 freight_value，主键(order_id, order_item_id)。需要选订单明细，按运费降序前5。应输出什么字段？ “哪几条” 需要标识订单明细，完整主键 order_id, order_item_id，以及运费。可能还 product_id/seller_id? 规则8：明确名称/编号/编码/输出列优先。问订单明细是哪几条，应该保留完整实体标识与指标。订单明细的完整主键是 order_id, order_item_id；指标 freight_value。可能输出 order_id, order_item_id, freight_value。不要加产品等未要求。按freight_value DESC。NULL处理：最值实体：仅该属性非NULL者参与最值。所以 WHERE freight_value IS NOT NULL。排序按运费降序，若同值按完整实体身份元组升序？规则8：主指标优先，仅同值按完整维度/实体身份元组升序、NULLS LAST裁决。因此 ORDER BY freight_value DESC, order_id ASC, order_item_id ASC LIMIT 5。只输出SQL。无代码围栏。注意不要引号。单表。需要LIMIT 5。最终只SELECT。"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2840,"completion_tokens":326,"total_tokens":3166,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":2688},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":283},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":2688,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":152},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}